Output docs/assets/kube-shield-tui.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "DejaVu Sans Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1240
Set Height 760
Set Padding 14
Set Framerate 18
Set PlaybackSpeed 1.0

Type "go run ./docs/demo/tui_demo.go"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

Tab
Sleep 900ms
Down
Down
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 1.1s
Escape
Sleep 600ms

Type "/"
Sleep 250ms
Type "rbac"
Sleep 350ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Enter
Sleep 1s
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Tab
Sleep 850ms
Tab
Sleep 850ms
Tab
Sleep 1.1s
Type "?"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "?"
Sleep 400ms
Type "q"
